{"id":"dqx211w767dg8fqztjdlrji36","title":"伯明翰大学团队在Angewandte Chemie发表稀土MOF配方化控制研究","originalTitle":"一个骨架，十六种金属——从一篇多金属稀土 MOF 论文看材料设计的“配方化”转向","summary":"伯明翰大学Neil Champness团队在Angewandte Chemie发表研究，通过单晶结构验证16种稀土金属在MOF骨架中的同构性，建立基于阳离子半径偏置的组成控制方案。实验显示Dy/La比例变化可调控磁响应（+3.2 emu/g）和CO2吸附量（5.72→1.23 mmol/g），为多金属催化材料设计提供新范式。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=52206&do=blog&id=1560192"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T03:29:32.990Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T03:29:32.990Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":54,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}